<title>JAPAN: Japan October oil product imports - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan October oil product imports - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Friday issued the following data on oil product imports for October (barrel equivalents are also shown):</p>
<p>	 (In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%   yr/yr %</p>
<p> Gasoline     121	  761    -    9.7  +   61.3</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,431     15,291    +   15.2  +   12.9</p>
<p> Kerosene     209	1,315    +   49.3  +1,990.0</p>
<p> Gas oil	151	  950    +2,920.0  +   42.5</p>
<p> Fuel oil A    88	  554    +    4.8  -   26.7</p>
<p> Fuel oil C   165	1,038    -   26.7  -   21.4</p>
<p>(Note: LSWR imports are included in the Fuel oil C statistics)</p>
</text>
